                "acceptedIntent": {
                    "keyType": "AVMString",
                    "valueType": "AVMBytes",
                    "key": "YWNjZXB0ZWRJbnRlbnQ=",
                    "desc": "Hash of the SettlementIntent the buyer signed when accepting.\n\nThis is what authorizes the payout. The terms themselves \u2014 buyer,\nprovider, asset, amount, expiry \u2014 are already immutable here, so what\nthe commitment adds is that the release must be the *same* settlement\nthe buyer accepted, nonce included. Without it, an API that accepts\none intent and releases against another is indistinguishable on-chain\nfrom an honest one."
                }
            },
